## Notes: Post- och telestyrelsen, for your chat channels: /pts lists every channel with a box to leave it, and a channel you leave stays left even when the game puts you back in it (General, Trade and the rest on every zone change). Optionally shorter channel names in chat: [G], [P], [2. T].
